these people, in general. In my language
learning experience, and I've been

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:46.009
learning so far
14 languages, I'm still not confident and

00:01:46.009 --> 00:01:51.140
I still fear and dread the idea of
speaking with native speakers when I'm

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:56.060
still not quite good with the language,
for example when I was in Poland and I

